### What were the stated goals or scope of the review into the World Health Organization's role that was announced alongside the funding halt?
Answer: The stated goal of the review was to "assess the World Health Organization's role in severely mismanaging and covering up the spread of the coronavirus." President Trump said the investigation would be a "thorough" one, expected to last 60 to 90 days. The scope, as outlined by his criticisms, included examining the WHO's "disastrous decision to oppose travel restrictions from China" and its alleged acceptance of "China's misinformation about the virus, saying it wasn't communicable and there was no need for travel bans."

